body:json {
  {
    "name": "Smith Family"
  }
}

docs {
  # Create Household
  
  Creates a new household and assigns the calling user as the admin.
  
  ## Authentication
  Requires a valid JWT token in the Authorization header (Bearer token).
  
  ## Request Body
  - `name` (required): Name of the household (e.g., "Smith Family")
  
  ## Response Fields
  - `id` (guid): Household identifier
  - `name` (string): Household name
  - `timeZoneId` (string): IANA timezone identifier
  - `createdUtc` (datetime): Creation timestamp
  - `members` (array): List of household members
  
  ## Error Responses
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Invalid or missing authentication token
  - `404 Not Found`: User not registered (call POST /users/register first)
  - `409 Conflict`: User already belongs to a household
}
